abstract: >-
  BioReviewPy is an open-source Python application designed to support
  bibliographic data management and evidence-synthesis workflows. It integrates
  bibliographic file importation, metadata harmonization, duplicate detection,
  manual verification of uncertain matches, record classification, screening
  support, audit tracking, and export of cleaned datasets within a
  semi-automated and auditable workflow.
